        <b><br>
        (1) FOR BUSINESS VISA THE INVITATION FROM ASSOCIATES IN INDONESIA SHOULD 
        COME ONLY THROUGH THE "DEPARTMENT OF IMMIGRATION" - JAKARTA AND SHOULD 
        BE FAXED DIRECTLY TO THE EMBASSY.A COPY OF THE SAME MAY BE ENCLOSED WITH 
        THE APPLICATION FOR REFERENCE.<br>
        </b><br>
        <b>(2) TOURIST VISA APPLICATIONS WILL BE REFERRED TO THE "DEPARTMENT OF 
        IMMIGRATION" - JAKARTA FOR APPROVAL AND IT WOULD TAKE APPROXIMATELY 10-15 
        WORKING DAYS.</b></font></div>
